WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Soft electronic music]
Stay in the work. Your AI limits in view.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Less guessing. More making.
Remaining Codex and Claude usage, together.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
5-hour and weekly windows.
Reported reset times. One quick glance.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
Keep the work in sight.
Codex tasks, projects, and observed activity.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
Local observations, not completion percentage.
All readings and tasks are sample data.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
Your turn. A question or approval request
signals when you’re needed.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.000
Peak observes.
Review and respond in Codex.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Feels like your space.
The native design changes from dark to light.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
Your color. A custom mauve appearance.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
There when you need it.
A hover opens the design preview.

00:30.000 --> 00:32.000
The island fades over a workspace.
Editorial interaction demonstration.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Keep your head in it. Meet Peak.
Free on the Microsoft Store. peakforwindows.vercel.app
